kiyama Shinobu) last installment,\"Lust\", in the famed series, \"Seven Deadly Sins\". He finds himself now in the body a dachshund! Also, the woman he saved now wants to adopt him. What will ensue in this strange string of events? What will become of Kazuhito? Who is the woman in black? Find out that and more in Dog & Scissors!","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":6.2}],"value":6.2,"age":"r"},"current_season_id":9654,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}